{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27266","headline":"赠刘宽夫昆季 · 章孝标","name":"赠刘宽夫昆季","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文聚星辰衣彩霞，问谁兄弟是刘家。\n雁行云掺参差翼，琼树风开次第花。\n天假声名悬日月，国凭骚雅变浮华。\n曾穷晋汉儒林传，龙虎虽多未足夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}